      "tpd_reading": "<div>\n<div>單元一/\n<div>關於因人廢言的謬誤/ fallacy of the genetic</div>\n\n<div>G1--身份認同/ fallacy of appeal to personal identity (personal experience)</div>\n\n<div>參考文本01</div>\n\n<div>G2--個別處境 / fallacy of particular position (the circumstantial)</div>\n\n<div>文本04:<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ssstg0uxEYI\">第12講-正義：一場思辨之旅-Michael Sandel (youtube.com)</a>(其中11:15-21:35內容)</div>\n\n<div>G3--訴求權威 / fallacy of appeal to authority or character)</div>\n\n<div>文本05:</div>\n\n<div>G4--訴求事件的起源歷史或個人的政經地位 / appeal to its origin or history</div>\n\n<div>文本06: (如右欄)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
